# The frozen paths of this repository: one shell glob per line, matched against the path from the repo root
# (`*` also crosses `/`). A line starting with ! excludes. The ONE home of the list: tsa-verify.sh fails when a
# frozen file has changed, scripts/frozen.py checks every frozen file against its OpenTimestamps proof, and the
# OpenTimestamps workflow stamps what scripts/frozen.py --unstamped lists.
CHARTER*.md
GOVERNANCE*.md
projects/*
hard-cases/*
redesigns/*
!*README.md
!*.ots
!*.bak
